    LLM: 'Ante. Deal 5 each (dealer 1 up). Player may fold (lose ante) or Raise (2× ante). Dealer reveals. Dealer must qualify (A-K or better). If qualified, compare hands; player wins 1:1 on ante, paytable on Raise. If not qualified, ante refunded, Raise push.',
